WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.720
- Let's pull up today's dose
of the joy from the inter webs.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.152
Y'all this is 'What I'm Liking'.

00:00:04.152 --> 00:00:07.160
(Upbeat intro music)

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.650
Some people have pet dogs,
others have cats or snakes,

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.930
even pigs, but one woman named Faith, in

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.500
San Diego has gone another direction.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.380
One of her pets is a 19 pound
mini horse named Peabody.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.130
Which is so cute.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:24.020
Peabody was born the runt
of the litter, and he was

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:27.450
in danger of being euthanized.
Faith trains mini horses

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:30.460
to be therapy animals. So
she decided to take him in,

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.250
and he's doing better than
she could've ever guessed.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.990
We have Faith on the line right now,

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:38.310
along with little Peabody.
They watch the show on

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.980
NBC 7, San Diego. What's up y'all?

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:45.280
Oh my gosh.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:50.280
If that does not bring joy
in your heart, you are dead.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.050
Oh my God. Peabody, you are so...

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:55.370
So tell us how Peabody
was, whenever you got him.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:01:00.370
- You know, I, I got him at
2 old and he couldn't walk.

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:04.633
He couldn't eat because
his jaw was out of line.

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:09.683
He was deaf. They thought he was blind.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.420
And I thought, well, they're
going to put him down.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:14.070
I'm going to take them
home and we'll give it a

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.620
shot, because he had a real will to live.

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:18.530
- He is the cutest
little guy on the planet.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:20.210
So, Peabody's come a long way since you

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:21.620
got him though, right?

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:25.240
- Oh, it's, Kelly, its like a miracle.

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:29.050
We found some special
shoes and we put them

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:32.220
on him, and we changed
them every couple weeks.

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:36.250
He is running around the
house now. We have, his

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:40.880
head has actually grown. So his
jaw is aligned. He's eating.

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:44.330
And his eyesight is really good.

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:47.530
And they say he's still
deaf, but I don't know.

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:52.530
He might have selective hearing.
But he makes people smile.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:58.020
He has over 300 million
views on the internet.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.970
And I get calls from all over the world.

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:03.750
There was one lady and she had polio.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:07.658
She said that when she saw
Peabody with his new shoes,

00:02:07.658 --> 00:02:12.658
stomping down that wood floor,
trying so hard, that it gave

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:16.807
her real purpose and it
motivated her. And she said,

00:02:16.807 --> 00:02:17.927
"I got out of bed". And she said,

00:02:17.927 --> 00:02:20.943
"I just started walking
again." So he just makes.

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:27.420
What I do is train miniature
horses for therapy, and we like

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:30.010
to go visit, but I never
dreamed that I would

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:31.970
be able to find a little horse, that would

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:35.180
be a therapy horse for the world.

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:37.230
- Oh my God. Peabody.

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:40.120
Oh my God. You are adorable.

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:43.560
You have made me smile on
the inside, man. Well done.

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:46.070
Thank you so much Faith for
sharing Peabody with us.

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:48.120
Alright. I'm liking your posts right now.

00:02:49.001 --> 00:02:50.950
(Audience Applause)

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:53.250
Well, that's not all,
our season long partner

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.960
Pilot penned the Goats,
who penned to the Kelly

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.170
Clarkson Show, thinks that what

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:58.330
you're doing is incredible.
So in recognition,

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:01.010
there'll be using their G2 gel
ink pen to write you a check

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.572
for a thousand dollars. How's that sound?

00:03:03.572 --> 00:03:06.418
- Oh my gosh. Thank you so much.

00:03:06.418 --> 00:03:08.575
Did you hear that Peabody?

00:03:08.575 --> 00:03:09.434
- Absolutely.

00:03:09.434 --> 00:03:10.267
- Thank you.

00:03:10.267 --> 00:03:12.170
- Peabody is getting some new shoes y'all.

